                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJpQgAfFquQjQRpp63uJbAbas/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZcEo2c1lnEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I got a recommendation from the hotel staff about this so-called Japanese izakaya, and honestly, it blew my mind! I had no idea it could be so much fun and the food so delicious. We sat at the counter, sipping drinks and enjoying small bites—Taiwanese people are just so nice! If you’re traveling, I highly recommend this izakaya in Taiwan. It feels like a brand in itself. The food was so comforting, even though we ate pretty quickly. The drinks and dishes left us so satisfied. I used to always visit Japan, but now Taiwan might just be my top favorite. I’ll definitely be back, and I recommend you check out this izakaya too!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
